    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ほんとだよ、君は余計なお節介が過ぎる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「むかしからの悪い癖だよ、しかもわりと見当ちがいだから始末に負えない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「反省しなよ、れいか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「けっきょく君は今回、何がしたかったんだい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「無理やり『新制服の考案』なんて簡単に始末がつきそうな事態に、無理やり一枚噛んでかき乱してさ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ふぅん、ひまりの発案だったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ひまりもそこにいるなら伝えてほしい、ううん僕が今から行ってお説教するね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕たちが、余計な気を回す必要なんてないんだよ。『新生徒会』は、僕たちの後継者は……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「君咲学院のみんなは、きっと大丈夫だよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕たちが卒業したあとも、立派にやっていくさ。それを確認できただけで、今回は収穫かな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「えへへ、かわいい制服も着られたし～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「あぁ、僕にかわいい制服を着せるのが目的だったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕の気持ちを汲んで、願いを叶えてくれたんだね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「あはは。謝らなくていいよ、れいか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「うん。たしかに、最初はそうだった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「お兄さまたちが不在で寂しがっている君のために、僕はその代理となった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「かわいく長くのばしていた髪を切り落として、『わたし』から『僕』になったんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「君を慰める、かりそめの『王子さま』にね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「でも、それは君のせいなんかじゃない。僕がそうしたいから、したんだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「君の涙が見ていられなかったから……。だからね、泣かないで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「いつでも笑っていて、れいか。お願いだよ、僕のお姫さま」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「『幸福の王子』は、きっと泣いてほしかったんじゃない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「幸せになってほしかったんだ、だから泣かないで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕も泣かないよ、満足して役目を終える」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「うん、うん。じゃあね、帰ったらすぐに君のところに行くよ。れいかとひまりと僕で、食事でもしよう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「『新制服の考案』について、話したいこともあるしね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「うん、そのぐらいで相応だよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「呑気に食事でもしながら、笑いあってお喋りしながら、僕たちの後継者たちが紡ぐ物語を観劇しよう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「これから先は、ずっと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
