    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「……あれっ、転校生くん。びっくりしたぁ、立ち聞きなんて悪趣味だよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ていうか気配ないよね、君もいま帰るとこ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「そっかぁ。『新制服の考案』については、明日また全体で協議してから方針を決めて再開……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「って感じなんだね、だから今日はもうやることないから帰るって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「うん。明日からも『補習』はつづく、君たちには来年度もある。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ゆっくり焦らず、でも計画的に着実に、やり遂げればいいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「応援してるよ、がんばってね生徒会長♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「あぁ、うん。せっかくだから、この制服のまま帰っちゃおうかなって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「着替えるのも面倒だしね、誰かに見られると困るからこっそり裏口から……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「あはは。僕のことを『王子さま』だと思ってる子に見られたら、騒ぎになっちゃうかもしれないからね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「見られたのが、君でよかったよ。ていうか何で君はこんなところにいるのさ、神出鬼没だなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「でも、ちょうどいいかも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「見える？　あそこで騒いでる一団がいるでしょ、あれは二年Ｂ組のみんなだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ちょっと、彼女らに付き添って帰ってもらえない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「曽根さんは、退院したとはいっても病気が完治したわけじゃないしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「まりあちゃんも、あの梅園さんって子も今日は倒れてたし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「心配なんだ、だから見守ってあげてほしい。家まで無事に、送り届けてあげて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕はほら、今日はもう『王子さま』じゃないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-new-girl",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-girl_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
